### ============================================================================
### SLOTS DEMO - PLAYER, PENDING TRANSACTIONS & ADMIN API REQUESTS
### Player UI: http://localhost:8080/
### Admin UI:  http://localhost:8080/admin.html (entered via promo code)
### Allowed crate items: IRON_CRATE (or "iron"), SILVER_CRATE (or "silver"), GOLD_CRATE (or "gold")
### ============================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@username = player1
@password = secret123
@newPassword = newSecret456

### 0) API Overview
GET {{host}}/api
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================================
### 1) Create User, Login, Promo Code, Change Password, Logout & Delete Account
### ============================================================================

### 1a) Create User (POST) - initializes balance=0, items=[]
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1b) Login User (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1c) Verify Promo Code (POST) - configured promo unlocks Admin page
POST {{host}}/api/users/promo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promo": "admin1234"
}

### 1d) Change Password (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/users/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### 1d-revert) Change Password back to original (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/users/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{newPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{password}}"
}

### 1e) Logout User (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/users/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1f) Delete Account (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/users/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### ============================================================================
### 2) Pending Deposit / Withdraw Requests & Admin Approval / Rejection
### ============================================================================

### 2a) Player Deposit Request (creates PENDING transaction; balance unchanged until approved)
POST {{host}}/api/users/balance/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "amount": 250.00
}

### 2b) Admin: Get All Pending Transactions Across All Users
GET {{host}}/api/admin/transactions/pending
Accept: application/json

### 2c) Admin: Approve Pending Transaction #1 (adds deposit amount to user balance)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/transactions/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json

### 2d) Player Withdraw Request (subtracts immediately & creates PENDING transaction)
POST {{host}}/api/users/balance/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "amount": 75.50
}

### 2e) Admin: Reject/Decline Pending Transaction #2 (refunds withdrawal back to user balance)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/transactions/2/reject
Content-Type: application/json


### ============================================================================
### 3) Buy Case on Marketplace (POST)
### Items & Prices: "pepe-iron" / "IRON_CRATE" ($2), "shiba-inu-gold" / "SILVER_CRATE" ($5), "doge-amethyst" / "GOLD_CRATE" ($11)
### ============================================================================

### 3a) Player: Buy a case from Marketplace (subtracts price from balance & adds to inventory)
POST {{host}}/api/users/items/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "item": "IRON_CRATE"
}


### ============================================================================
### 4) Change User's Luck (POST)
### Luck must be between 0.0 and 1.0
### ============================================================================
POST {{host}}/api/users/luck
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "luck": 0.0
}


### ============================================================================
### 5) Get Users & Admin User Overview (GET)
### ============================================================================

### 5a) Get all users (no arguments)
GET {{host}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### 5b) Get top 3 most rich users for LIVE leaderboard
GET {{host}}/api/users/top
Accept: application/json

### 5c) Get 1 specific user (player endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/users/user?username={{username}}&password={{password}}
Accept: application/json

### 5d) Admin: Find specific user (returns username, balance, pending transactions, cases)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{username}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================================
### 6) Get 1 User's Balance, Items, or Luck (GET)
### ============================================================================

### 6a) Get 1 user's balance
GET {{host}}/api/users/balance?username={{username}}&password={{password}}
Accept: application/json

### 6b) Get 1 user's items
GET {{host}}/api/users/items?username={{username}}&password={{password}}
Accept: application/json

### 6c) Get 1 user's luck
GET {{host}}/api/users/luck?username={{username}}&password={{password}}
Accept: application/json
